Z||000000||fieroshop||06-07-2001||01:43 AM||||After much discussion with the CFOG board, it was decided to reduce the price of the drawing to be held on July 14th at San Leandro, CA. during the West Fest in half.<BR>We will still only sell 3000 tickets.<BR>For those of you who have purchased tickets will will send you a like amount so that you will not feel that you are spending more then the rest of the people.<BR>If you spend $50.00 dollars and received six tickets we will send you another six.<BR>You can find the information on <A HREF="http://www.cfog.org" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cfog.org</A> <BR>Thanks to those that have bought tickets in supporting this event.<BR>We do have a few tickets left, so hurry up and get some.<P>------------------<BR> <BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroshop_sig_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
